# Ad-hoc kickoff / dev-scaffolding scripts (TEMPORARY, not product code)
# PR-BT-4/5 Phase 3 docs-sync F-IMPL-L-05 (TDA L-03 ≡ LCC L-5, IO ruling: exclude
# from commit scope; `_`-prefixed `_kickoff-*.cjs` are transient dev scaffolding,
# kept untracked rather than deleted so they remain reusable). IO Impl Decision V0
# anchor `019e65a3-aaf7`.
apps/mcp-server/scripts/_kickoff-*.cjs

