# Parallel-agent worktrees (Claude Code Agent tool isolation:"worktree" artifacts)
# C-6 operational artifacts scope extension (IO judgment):
# .claude/worktrees/agent-*/ are stale subagent worktrees that pollute
# format:check / docs:verify scans. Excluded defensively for future runs.
.claude/worktrees/
